          "path": "_m/e/y/x/m/port-of-cartagena-wp/all-sizes-shapes-and-colors-52.jpg",
          "filename": "All Sizes, Shapes, and Colors (52532530389).jpg",
          "caption": "Quite and eclectic mix of boats in the Cartagena harbor!\nIn the middle forefront you can see the rowing sculls from the previously mentioned competition.  Look up and a bit left and you see the  megayachts Bravo Eugenia and the Vibrant Curiousity.  For those of you who are Dallas Cowboy fans you might be interested to know that Jerry Jones owns the Bravo Eugenia!  Look a little past them and you'll see the Spanish Naval Ships Segura (M31), the Tambre (M33) and the Tajo (M36) which are Mine Countermeasure ships!  A nice mix of fun, pleasure, and business!",
          "alt": "Quite and eclectic mix of boats in the Cartagena harbor!\nIn the middle forefront you can see the rowing sculls from the previously mentioned competition.  Look up and a bit left and you see the  megayachts Bravo Eugenia and the Vibrant Curiousity.  For those of you who are Dallas Cowboy fans you might be interested to know that Jerry Jones owns the Bravo Eugenia!  Look a little past them and you'll see the Spanish Naval Ships Segura (M31), the Tambre (M33) and the Tajo (M36) which are Mine Countermeasure ships!  A nice mix of fun, pleasure, and business!",
          "width": 5715,
          "height": 3810,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
          "artist": "A Guy Named Nyal",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:All_Sizes,_Shapes,_and_Colors_(52532530389).jpg",
